{"ok": true, "messages": [{"ts": "1759264805.214409", "type": "message", "text": "Before Thursday's flow review I want the queue manager to be a real epic. Right now it is one ticket, and Vincent's flow pass is a sheet on its own. I left a note on the ticket about how I want it. One child for each area, and every report gets its line under the right child. Please also put a stock-take sheet in your ZM queue manager folder and share it with everyone on the review invite, Leonard too, and add one slide with the numbers to your queue manager deck. When it is done tell me here how many reports are passed, how many wait on QA, how many wait on a fix, how many areas are clear and how many reports are on the review list.", "channel": "D0770ET6WBW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1759264784.871309", "type": "message", "text": "Hello!", "channel": "D0770ET6WBW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1759173978.039839", "type": "message", "text": "it looks great on the video", "channel": "D0770ET6WBW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1759173965.252559", "type": "message", "text": "No problem :))", "channel": "D0770ET6WBW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1759173921.310649", "type": "message", "text": "Okay sure, no problem .. I was fixing some issues I encountered myself .. couldn't trigger it before  :[USERNAME_7156]:", "channel": "D0770ET6WBW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0006_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1759173860.807449", "type": "message", "text": "Thank you!", "channel": "D0770ET6WBW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1759173857.856219", "type": "message", "text": "Hello! I don't have any time to test today. But I'll test it tomorrow", "channel": "D0770ET6WBW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1759173608.518609", "type": "message", "text": "Hi [PERSON_NAME_0092], when you have time could you test Match 3D iOS Internal - #1746
it's for card animation VFX implementation. let me know if that's okay to make a PR later.", "channel": "D0770ET6WBW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0006_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1759164072.337219", "type": "message", "text": "For the flow review on Friday I want to go through collect&amp;win and daily gift first, the rest can come after", "channel": "D0770ET6WBW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758809135.751339", "type": "message", "text": "Thanks", "channel": "D0770ET6WBW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758809090.200389", "type": "message", "text": "I'm looking on that bug to not play coin animation again if user kills the app", "channel": "D0770ET6WBW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0006_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758808940.783819", "type": "message", "text": "Yeah, still waiting to implement on [PERSON_NAME_0067]'s branch... He'll need to update from main", "channel": "D0770ET6WBW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0006_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758808900.412489", "type": "message", "text": "When  users kills the app, they see coin animation again", "channel": "D0770ET6WBW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758808878.060579", "type": "message", "text": "Additionaly, we need fix the other bug", "channel": "D0770ET6WBW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758808795.588519", "type": "message", "text": "We talked with [PERSON_NAME_0050], the input blocker is not a problem right now. Probably we need to check that after adding collect&amp;win to queuemanager", "channel": "D0770ET6WBW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758808721.999729", "type": "message", "text": "Hello!", "channel": "D0770ET6WBW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758732457.704099", "type": "message", "text": "Thanks!", "channel": "D0770ET6WBW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758732311.141009", "type": "message", "text": "Yeah I'll need to add it  to the queue manager once is merged", "channel": "D0770ET6WBW", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0006_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758730948.999939", "